  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 moves the built-in utility table into a declarative format: Utilities/builtins.css is embedded in Khamsin.Core and parsed by UtilitySheet into the same registry, with cascade order derived from the emitted CSS properties (file position as fallback, an explicit order clause as override). The khamsin.json \"utilities\" key now accepts CSS @utility sheets that extend the built-in registry: custom utilities work with every variant, join conflict resolution through their group, get KHM005 validation and @property registration, ride library attributes to consuming apps, and reach the runtime merger through the generated ThemeRegistration. 0.5.0 also fixes: nothing else; the table migration is behavior-preserving (structural equivalence was verified entry-by-entry against the retired C# table).",
